Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["Positive bias: 0.855 V / 5549", "Section",ExpressionUUID->"55f2db9c-4ef1-426b-854f-b94c088030db"],

Cell["\<\
Positive bias 0.855 V / 5549 (main text). The cycle 1 -> 3 -> 2 -> 1 is \
driven almost one way and carries almost all the dissipation; state 4 is \
visited only now and then. Panels: (a) duration distributions for 1 -> 3 with \
the counts in the inset, (b) their cumulative difference, (c), (d) the \
estimators for 1 -> 3, a boundary observable of A = {3}, with bootstrap bars \
against the naive W (dashed). \
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{
  4.003919758490206*^9},ExpressionUUID->"25aad11b-6f41-4a93-a397-\
10af925dd733"],

