Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["Negative bias: -0.955 V / 6013", "Section",ExpressionUUID->"2ac59c42-584b-407b-963e-f8cdacbefe2e"],

Cell["\<\
Negative bias -0.955 V / 6013 (Supplemental Material). The triangle 1-2-3 is \
balanced and state 4 is visited one way, 2 -> 4 -> 3. Panels: (a) every edge \
observable, (b) durations for 1 -> 3 (control), (c), (d) the observable 4 -> \
3, a boundary observable of A = {3}, with rigorous lower limits against the \
naive W (line) and its Poisson band from the recorded 3 -> 4 jumps (shaded). \
\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{
  4.003920268276066*^9},ExpressionUUID->"986cba08-3a0b-4668-8fd0-\
d4f7cf2bb1c4"],

