Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["Positive bias: 0.705 V / 5515", "Section",ExpressionUUID->"0c4cb196-45a6-4466-942f-b472bf97e985"],

Cell["\<\
Positive bias 0.705 V / 5515 (Supplemental Material). At this bias state 4 is \
visited often enough (about 0.8% of the samples) to form its own peak in the \
signal histogram, and a four-Gaussian fit resolves it: the occupation plot \
shows that (20) is a genuine charge state. Its dynamics are nearly reversible \
here (4 -> 3: 137/125), and the edges of state 4 carry only about 1% of the \
naive entropy production. Panels and statistics as for 5549. \
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{
  4.003920071201549*^9},ExpressionUUID->"63c2a8a3-cc5e-4ab0-9dbe-\
910deb4e7246"],

