Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["Benchmark on emulated experiments", "Section",ExpressionUUID->"8b1cdc77-9711-4153-862b-4d86e82edad9"],

Cell["\<\
Benchmark of the estimators on emulated experiments (Supplemental Material). \
The data have no ground truth, so we emulate them: ten random models built \
from random fundamental affinities, with rates and occupations in the range \
of the three runs, each simulated for 1915 s and recorded by a detector with \
the sampling interval, levels and noise of 5549. Each record goes through the \
same pipeline as the data, and four estimates of A_max and sigma are \
compared: the ground truth, a Baum-Welch fit of a hidden Markov model to the \
raw signal, the naive W, and the excursion estimators for 1 <-> 3. All random \
numbers follow from benchSeed, set at the top of the Estimates cell: change \
it and evaluate Estimates and Plots again for a new set of models. Evaluate \
the Setup section first. \
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{
  4.003920464163192*^9},ExpressionUUID->"a4520cf9-f554-4b77-886c-\
dfd0fe29a5b8"],

